########## mainnet ##########
CommitOnce — what is the real slot rate?
  rpc      https://api.mainnet-beta.solana.com
  version  4.3.0-rc.0
  window   30s

  slots    449856594 -> 449856711  (117 slots)
  elapsed  31.03s  (26 advancing samples)
  rate     3.770 slots/second  (265.2 ms/slot)

  the constant in the program is 4 slots/second.
  measured is SLOWER by 5.7%.

  Consequence, given that `close_receipt` requires BOTH deadlines:
    faster than 4  -> the slot gate passes early, the wall-clock gate binds,
                      so the window is exactly as advertised.
    slower than 4  -> the slot gate passes late, so cleanup is delayed.
    Either way cleanup can only be delayed, never accelerated.

